{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"additions\": [\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch3:1\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0092\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供粪便SCFA水平与抗PD-1疗效正相关的临床队列证据，确立其作为疗效预测标志物的实证基础。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0503\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示血清丁酸/丙酸与抗CTLA-4预后负相关，阐明SCFA效应的靶点依赖性与情境反转。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0515\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详述丁酸通过HDAC抑制上调Pdcd1/Cd28增强CD8+ T细胞记忆，同时提示Treg分化的双向潜力。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0377\",\n          \"contribution\": \"展示缺氧微环境中癌细胞逆向摄取丁酸供能的反常现象，凸显代谢物效应的微环境阈值依赖性。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0559\",\n          \"contribution\": \"绘制微生物代谢物调节抗肿瘤免疫的高阶机制图谱，详细区分不同代谢物对PD-1与CTLA-4抑制剂疗效的差异化影响（如丁酸盐的双刃剑效应）。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch3:2\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0582\",\n          \"contribution\": \"核心文献，证实肌苷直接结合UBA6解除MHC-I抑制，并指出人体肿瘤内实测浓度缺失的关键转化缺口。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0124\",\n          \"contribution\": \"阐释双歧杆菌来源肌苷经A2AR/cAMP通路促进Th1分化及作为替代碳源维持效应T细胞存活的平行机制。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供腺苷脱氨酶将免疫抑制性腺苷转化为肌苷的药代动力学数据，说明肌苷半衰期延长对微环境暴露的意义。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0588\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供肌苷联合ICI治疗晚期实体瘤的首个随机对照临床II期数据，证实了肌苷在延长PFS方面的统计学显著性，并为“肠道代谢物调节免疫治疗”假说提供了初步临床支持。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n          \"contribution\": \"建立基于单细胞分辨率的药物诱导TME重塑量化框架，发现别嘌醇通过嘌呤补救途径增加肌苷分泌、增强肿瘤免疫原性和T细胞功能的分子机制。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch3:3\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0481\",\n          \"contribution\": \"证实牛磺脱氧胆酸经TGR5受体直接增强CD8+ T细胞毒性，并在菌群失调模型中恢复ICI疗效。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0180\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示次级胆汁酸结合非经典核受体RORγt与NR4A1，精细调控Th17/Treg平衡的分子细节。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0209\",\n          \"contribution\": \"阐明色氨酸代谢物IPA通过AhR维持CD8+ T细胞干性（Tcf7超增强子），并与抗PD-1产生协同效应。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0424\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供不可切除肝细胞癌队列中次级胆汁酸丰度与更长PFS的正向关联，连接特定菌群与临床预后。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0186\",\n          \"contribution\": \"基于毛螺菌科比较基因组学预测胆汁酸转化基因簇，为核受体配体生成提供菌株特异性功能线索。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch3:4\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0444\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供宏基因组功能通路（MEP、核黄素合成）与特定T细胞亚群（Vδ2、MAIT）活化直接关联的纵向队列证据。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0220\",\n          \"contribution\": \"阐述代谢物作为表观遗传修饰底物或直接抑制HDAC，改变染色质开放性以重编程巨噬细胞与T细胞转录程序。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0587\",\n          \"contribution\": \"整合多组学数据揭示微生物代谢物系统性调节宿主免疫细胞氧化磷酸化与糖酵解平衡，决定效应与耗竭T细胞命运。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n          \"contribution\": \"批判单一分类学分析的局限，主张采用多组学整合与机器学习模型捕捉代谢功能的动态变化以替代传统多样性指标。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_key\": \"Ch3:5\",\n      \"studies\": [\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0582\",\n          \"contribution\": \"明确指出因样本完整性问题未能在人体肿瘤队列中直接检测肌苷浓度，仅能以UBA6表达作为通路活性代理。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0363\",\n          \"contribution\": \"强调多数机制证据来自小鼠模型，血浆/粪便浓度不能完全代表TME暴露水平，警示跨物种外推风险。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n          \"contribution\": \"指出体外有效浓度（如100 μM肌苷）属人工设定而非内源性实测值，体内浓度受血流灌注与降解酶多重制约。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source_handle\": \"P0413\",\n          \"contribution\": \"从药理学角度分析代谢物在TME中的递送效率受血管通透性及转运体限制，导致全身循环与局部有效浓度脱节。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","reasoning_content":"Here's a thinking process:\n\n1.  **Analyze User Input:**\n    - **Role:** Academic Review Planning Editor.\n    - **Goal:** Create a long-form review with a clear argumentative主线 (main thread). Plan substantive content in Chinese. Keep original titles/proper nouns. No Q&A format.\n    - **Scope Constraints:** Focus on substantive knowledge/analysis for the review body. Exclude intro, scope declaration, abstract, final summary (handled by independent modules later). Background/concepts/theory/mechanisms/method comparisons/future directions needed for understanding are part of the body. Each chapter needs a clear knowledge question/analytical task.\n    - **Structure/Scale:** Determined by research question, discipline context, existing materials. No single paradigm forced. Theory/method/design organized by actual argument structure. Center on user's research question. Provide overarching perspective & synthesis judgment supported by material connections/differences/evolution. Judge relevance based on RQ & materials. Don't let local gaps dominate the main thread. Only describe scope supported by existing materials, correct overstatements. Route summary vs interpretation_limits conflict -> limits win. Original study & direct sources have equal weight. Keep source metadata/R# namespaces. Use broad materials when evidence is sufficient, don't force quantity. Distinguish correlation/causation/mechanism/migration/validation/uncertainty. Don't upgrade unmet search gaps to field-level deficits. Don't let same gap dominate multiple chapters. Describe only what existing materials support. Correct previous overstatements. Map short handles to canonical IDs locally.\n    - **Task:** For already coordinated writing units, pick available literature cases. `source_materials` provides actual material for each candidate (A summary, B planning, plus deep reads/supplements/local snippets). Read all `source_routing` & `source_materials`, compare with `unit_catalog`, pick materials that truly support the unit's objects, results, conditions, or useful contrasts. Target ~150-200 independent lit for the whole review (not per chapter/batch). Quality target, not quota. Don't repeat existing sources, don't force irrelevant ones, don't use \"few core papers\" as a rule. Only supplement specific units, don't change chapter structure. New papers must add different results/conditions/methods/stages/useful contrasts; if just repeating same generalization, leave in pool, `additions` can be empty. Write contribution: ~30-60 words explaining what this material helps explain in this unit (specific writing purpose), can propose proposed synthesis. This text is specific writing purpose, not paper result. Paper methods/results/conclusions come from attached A/B/deep reads/supplements. Recommended uses cannot say analogies/schemes/other objects' results as direct empirical evidence for this problem. `material_available` false means no actual content, don't fabricate. Current call only responsible for one `chapter_id`. Complete `source_routing` may be chunked, don't fabricate missing sources. Return JSON only.\n    - **Input Data:** `chapter_id`: \"Ch3\", `unit_catalog` has 5 units (Ch3:1 to Ch3:5). `source_routing` and `source_materials` contain extensive information about various papers (P0357, P0363, P0369, P0372, P0377, P0382, P0391, P0401, P0413, P0415, P0422, P0424, P0427, P0432, P0433, P0437, P0439, P0443, P0444, P0446, P0447, P0451, P0452, P0454, P0455, P0462, P0464, P0472, P0473, P0476, P0477, P0479, P0481, P0486, P0496, P0499, P0500, P0503, P0506, P0507, P0510, P0511, P0514, P0515, P0516, P0518, P0519, P0521, P0522, P0523, P0532, P0540, P0542, P0543, P0544, P0550, P0552, P0553, P0554, P0555, P0557, P0559, P0563, P0569, P0571, P0574, P0577, P0582, P0584, P0586, P0587, P0588, P0589, P0591, P0592, P0593, P0594, P0596, etc.).\n    - **Units to Plan:**\n        - Ch3:1: SCFAs dual immune regulation via HDAC/GPCR, context-dependent on ICI target, microenvironment, concentration.\n        - Ch3:2: Inosine targets UBA6, enhances immunogenicity/T-cell sensitivity, but lacks TME absolute concentration data; clinical association based on plasma.\n        - Ch3:3: Secondary bile acids & tryptophan metabolites activate host nuclear receptors (FXR, TGR5, AhR, RORγt) to reshape myeloid/lymphoid polarization.\n        - Ch3:4: Metabolites reshape energy metabolism & epigenetic landscape of immune cells; functional pathway features > single species classification.\n        - Ch3:5: Evidence relies on plasma/feces as systemic exposure proxies; human TME absolute concentration data is a key translational gap, especially for inosine.\n\n2.  **Map Sources to Units (Mental Filtering & Selection):**\n    I need to select sources from the provided list that genuinely support each unit's substantive point, cases, or paragraph briefs. I will aim for high-quality, directly relevant sources, ensuring contributions are specific (~30-60 Chinese characters).\n\n    *Unit Ch3:1 (SCFAs)*\n    - Needs: SCFA mechanisms (HDAC, GPCR), context-dependency (PD-1 vs CTLA-4, hypoxia, concentration thresholds).\n    - Candidates: P0092 (clinical PD-1 positive), P0503 (clinical CTLA-4 negative), P0515 (mechanistic HDAC/Treg/CD8+), P0377 (hypoxia/dual role), P0413 (context dependency), P0559 (dual role/context), P0503 (already noted), P0515 (already noted).\n    - Selection:\n        - P0092: 提供粪便SCFA水平与抗PD-1疗效正相关的临床队列证据，确立其作为疗效预测标志物的实证基础。\n        - P0503: 揭示血清丁酸/丙酸与抗CTLA-4预后负相关，阐明SCFA效应的靶点依赖性与情境反转。\n        - P0515: 详述丁酸通过HDAC抑制上调Pdcd1/Cd28增强CD8+ T细胞记忆，同时提示Treg分化的双向潜力。\n        - P0377: 展示缺氧微环境中癌细胞逆向摄取丁酸供能的反常现象，凸显代谢物效应的微环境阈值依赖性。\n        - P0559: 绘制微生物代谢物调节抗肿瘤免疫的高阶机制图谱，详细区分不同代谢物对PD-1与CTLA-4抑制剂疗效的差异化影响（如丁酸盐的双刃剑效应）。\n\n    *Unit Ch3:2 (Inosine & UBA6)*\n    - Needs: Inosine targets UBA6, relieves inhibition on inflammation/MHC-I, enhances tumor immunogenicity & T-cell killing. Lacks TME absolute concentration data; clinical association based on plasma.\n    - Candidates: P0582 (core mechanism + CheckMate 025 plasma data + TME gap), P0124 (Bifidobacterium source, A2AR/cAMP, carbon source), P0584 (ADA converts adenosine to inosine, PK half-life, measurement window challenge), P0588 (Phase 2 RCT clinical efficacy + mechanism citation), P0593 (Allopurinol increases inosine, TME remodeling framework, retrospective bladder cancer survival link).\n    - Selection:\n        - P0582: 核心文献，证实肌苷直接结合UBA6解除MHC-I抑制，并指出人体肿瘤内实测浓度缺失的关键转化缺口。\n        - P0124: 阐释双歧杆菌来源肌苷经A2AR/cAMP通路促进Th1分化及作为替代碳源维持效应T细胞存活的平行机制。\n        - P0584: 提供腺苷脱氨酶将免疫抑制性腺苷","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1791151314,"id":"chatcmpl-26a15b5f-b28d-9464-ac9d-e21538966ae1","model":"qwen3.7-flash","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":3559,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":2048,"text_tokens":3559},"prompt_tokens":256467,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"text_tokens":256467},"total_tokens":260026}}